# Commits that changed nothing but layout, so `git blame` keeps naming whoever
# wrote the line rather than whoever had rustfmt run over the whole tree.
#
# This file is read by nothing until it is named once per clone:
#
#     git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
#
# GitHub reads it without being told. It stays at the root next to `.gitignore`
# because that is the path the command above gives, and because git looks for no
# other place for a file of its own.
